WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:06.000
What did you experience on October 7?

00:07.800 --> 00:13.566
I've been in the same room with my wife Nira,

00:14.466 --> 00:19.200
my daughter Dor and her child Rif,

00:19.300 --> 00:21.066
he was 2 years old.

00:21.666 --> 00:26.600
And in the same time her oldest one was with the other

00:26.766 --> 00:29.033
grandmother and father.

00:29.033 --> 00:30.933
They are living in the kibbutz

00:32.833 --> 00:34.766
in a more dangerous place.

00:34.800 --> 00:38.866
It's Gefen, then he was 4 years old,

00:40.566 --> 00:42.833
and his father,

00:42.833 --> 00:44.433
my son in law,

00:44.433 --> 00:48.566
Dekel, wasn't in the same unit of the kibbuz.

00:48.900 --> 00:51.766
He was going outside,

00:51.966 --> 00:54.533
outside,

00:54.766 --> 00:55.933
to protect us.

00:57.700 --> 01:01.666
I was in charge in the safe room about the boy,

01:01.966 --> 01:03.433
about his mother,

01:03.766 --> 01:07.433
and two dogs that we have in the safe room.

01:07.566 --> 01:09.266
My wife Nira,

01:10.733 --> 01:12.833
years ago she was in the army.

01:12.833 --> 01:15.933
So we say about her that

01:16.366 --> 01:18.966
"You can take her out of the army,"

01:18.966 --> 01:21.066
"but you can not take the army out of her"

01:21.633 --> 01:23.200
So she was

01:27.866 --> 01:31.466
She collected all the SOS messages

01:31.466 --> 01:34.000
from the people and

01:34.000 --> 01:36.800
sent it to the army.

01:40.533 --> 01:43.033
She sent them

01:43.033 --> 01:45.333
the location from WhatsApp.

01:47.166 --> 01:51.366
The army, she knew for every commander

01:52.533 --> 01:54.533
in the part of the kibbutz where he is

01:56.100 --> 01:58.866
and she sent them to the people,

01:58.866 --> 02:00.000
to help people.

02:00.900 --> 02:03.133
And when she got out at

02:03.733 --> 02:05.133
Sunday,

02:05.133 --> 02:08.866
2:30 am, we got out,

02:09.166 --> 02:11.900
she decided to to stay in the kibbutz.

02:11.900 --> 02:14.766
We were going to to Kibbutz Shefayim,

02:15.500 --> 02:18.066
and she decided to stay in the kibbutz,

02:18.066 --> 02:20.933
to help the soldiers.

02:21.933 --> 02:23.733
Until Monday they took (evacuated)

02:25.366 --> 02:28.466
the alive people and after that

02:28.466 --> 02:31.633
for two and a half more days

02:32.633 --> 02:36.800
they had to identify our friends,

02:37.866 --> 02:40.433
the dead ones. The dead people.

02:40.966 --> 02:42.333
She identified

02:43.833 --> 02:46.800
most of the people who got killed here.

02:47.933 --> 02:51.200
And after that she came

02:51.333 --> 02:54.366
to Shefayim, came back to me.

02:59.333 --> 03:01.566
I don't know how to describe it,

03:02.366 --> 03:04.100
of course, but not in English.

03:04.100 --> 03:08.433
But we tried to rebuild our life again.

03:09.066 --> 03:10.200
It was...

03:12.033 --> 03:12.933
until now

03:13.866 --> 03:15.066
It's very

03:16.066 --> 03:18.133
very hard to do it,

03:18.133 --> 03:21.300
because of Gali and Ziv (Berman),

03:21.300 --> 03:23.366
because we don't have a house.

03:23.433 --> 03:25.766
We are refugees in our country.

03:27.066 --> 03:31.000
And because so many people

03:32.866 --> 03:34.400
are not with us now.

03:35.566 --> 03:39.466
They are gone and it's hard to

03:39.733 --> 03:42.800
to rebuild the life, but we're trying

03:44.266 --> 03:47.566
I hope that soon we'll be able

03:47.566 --> 03:49.400
to come (back) to Kfar Aza.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.766
It will take a year or something,

03:50.766 --> 03:53.466
but I hope that we will.
